<p>You project ethereal fingers inside the target's brain.</p><p>Over <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 7, 9, 10, 12</acronym> turns it will take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">210, 283, 339, 387, 429</acronym> total mind damage and have its mental save reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 30, 47, 59, 70.</acronym></p><p>This powerful effect uses 130% of your Mindpower to try to overcome your target's initial mental save.</p><p>If you do not have two mindstars equiped, but have them in your off set, you instantly automatically switch. The wild psionic powers are incompatible with the focused nature of psiblades.</p>